    {
      "id": "9b83fff6-5e3c-4b95-8e07-3d50f91c0384",
      "title": "Observe a frase, escute o áudio e ligue a forma ao sentido em português.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "421b5587-bd98-47d8-bc4c-c7873501cc33",
          "textContent": "<p>Observe a forma usada para falar de si.</p><p><strong>Soy Ana.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Eu sou Ana.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/c783a1473a054852aec2304984f57057_b01-soy-ana.png?Expires=1794099390&Signature=xsTsZWPV~C59H7dYF~LNamKD8bD8cwtNkHqwUFSV~y9H7pYsIWCgD-NEdDton3ztYnycCVMqPXQT-HfGGAlUSZYgvg1z-n~ml4KLqSHKzKCfpfc6HR6V3MHjGU-GVcea1kmxjUpz3o1TxVDyUn3BlIgalEuY0qjlpsV-96t3PfohP5EYWX879MpOwyhe76mI84kvKwZZ2f8xwtBr9lLzqW~nrA8iEAlESr9rGL~nKD~5zQC4zbmWmXTnpUWKcvHp0cE0lqSiDICOtQVew~4pQKYsAk5Uw7ltN68p01dwOjj0A0-q37oIiTZIEHOyeZP4pwjza00hzg-f2bNV0EB83A__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/7d5ec7d52bda4ab5984517bf39fea17e_b01-soy-ana.mp3?Expires=1794099390&Signature=dUpTAUc9ruaFnJnuOdEC3kCnBpLA22YDbTsL99ZB0g5bR0PMUioxsSNZlL-HflR0YuDgivwV~D2wrrF9MpS-kjNhkilIP6xO6p0JGi6Vh91tvJlFcXift4fRMfWhMSsMOqoSHVN7Q-bK9Q-UvyCsuLepXlC9DwNdm-1cOTw7D4fGbtd0I7xPR-q2gfCUZsqtZo3~-6oCsFzb2F5hYg7JcDJvhNQxuZBYPyMBjmy9hIhUYCYHek4~b6MU6hdxiCAQdI31wZMLX~ubUMTQ~-XGzM6AspUKSwPTgbxSfR17h5SmgYHIp~g8SCMAGkeUo0Ms1BPe9Em6aefOa41DjnhoHw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
