    {
      "id": "f4299adb-4b68-42e4-ac66-512af31eeee2",
      "title": "Leia a nota curta e compare as duas maneiras de dizer a mesma coisa.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "f5c3f0ea-bcd8-4445-8773-c50d00028285",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>soy</strong> combina com <strong>yo</strong>.</p><p>Quando você fala de si, o pronome pode aparecer ou não.</p><p><strong>Soy Ana.</strong> e <strong>Yo soy Ana.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "955e089e-23ff-4bd7-b9ef-af21bc298031",
      "title": "Observe a pergunta, escute o áudio e note quem recebe a pergunta.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "53154a1a-0c6e-4914-ae38-2793e7c675e5",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora veja a forma usada para falar com a outra pessoa.</p><p><strong>¿Eres Julia?</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Você é Julia?</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/59ab6eda22b24ca999de6ea6ecf3441f_b03-eres-julia.png?Expires=1794099390&Signature=Jhd~IFVZFFXzv1YieElsGcj-El4eHsN0S0CtbG7PfBBeUxmgwJf3rxSVVMa4eAK~RVtJMwfphFtCCWthXXlzhH~~~QeQLwb0lLYyAvKndSk0MHCW4KxuCiNeKYSx~a3hYCt7AmQxgtMLHaEV6ZVTQH0smCHX-pXnQPpbGAQcS3uguJ-dRRk9N-lCex~8wlv742mYnmQQISJOgejd1PnJ96YHX9HHFBKLgMQtdMJ04IKBh~HZCFpWK7fFJk9i5boGa~V0GReayqMXGou16pRD9Mq6Vj5I1EU2sNPm0XS0EskyutppDYH0a00eRN5uGL2MCZocwgTTyUtoE3-DdmGnag__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/aa282c5417a74b3d89fff06d288bb5dd_b03-eres-julia.mp3?Expires=1794099390&Signature=qK7P4sNhEsPZC2B7tTDz4YiaSt~a~uUnBpZKp8NJfWW-qqjzKy1zu25jUAvdzstbK0RJGIAKEGVzml6o5QPHNILVBpoZwR3VeQDxO49mrUqT8RJA5vbd3Tan1UbL9xHqUSJL3HHaXLMA2Jkeb40Z3ajh5Z6wVhq-C0Lrz0xUC8laNmmlu2DtvYg1LDo~bWS2T8vUSgrW5Ses7RYYzxxqSo5KkAKuOJ2nf0DlHctyJFFPZPttxzk1TgnHnP-17fmaTkpGmpH7vmJXkSDOaOqUfmC6fHuz~H7gaCQ6vyxtIgbPzvDHazWDD~DLMk9fzM38ey1nZpOQCoESzoqSom7dOA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
