    {
      "id": "cb34136d-8af6-4efa-842d-2190221a1efe",
      "title": "Leia a explicação curta e observe o par pergunta e afirmação.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "9581d4fb-fd15-4624-8311-b798c3cd613d",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>eres</strong> aparece quando você fala com a outra pessoa.</p><p>Ela pode entrar numa pergunta ou numa afirmação.</p><p><strong>¿Eres Julia?</strong></p><p><strong>Tú eres Julia.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "82e05227-2553-4f83-ad49-043186150fb9",
      "title": "Observe a frase, escute o áudio e repare em quem está sendo apresentada.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "1d3fc2af-1b55-4aee-b842-54e875cf9773",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora veja a forma usada para falar de outra pessoa.</p><p><strong>Ella es Marta.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Ela é Marta.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/296c878052e74d26b1b419b94326bc1a_b05-ella-es-marta.png?Expires=1794099390&Signature=kxVBt-TQxIbf0mybxhdEFmV-fND12hHLL-M3x4XVPm5xDuI0wIx9ICbcTgM1QsPER7AK454vFv4ywDZV8Pt3TBW1nUCcr7Yev2nhre9WyiztuM~pXrWmNMHZrKtCwR3TfNZSZCRa3UMX~ER4bIy8yus65j44a~0svuPMvbGnGv5NSyYT7p5FHsb1PTB5yFXElMnb1z8QXRUWHbCXS~nhmvwlR~GIZAMdzyxDpHrQO-XWUHDfOrOj9ACXq~18fQrJZZGhYqjUl05rPAPXqr8RXF9d75VM~eJi3W0N2f5SrZb0W4RC6CpPKxXT5WBCEk7JBt~c-U8ccTNeCyViMDbQTg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/8895b6a88ba64c9884d448f1fe6c7b92_b05-ella-es-marta.mp3?Expires=1794099390&Signature=EW0jdkjW2SHFGBkrARn9wkaZKcaVIyufRAVI4syAHkMXtC~LaWij~R8Y8qyOBhCJqc~PiaKDaldrT1IUNd5~lDs~Xsf9F0RVNVo8GLQBzIQhEUse4oHHy3mXwcM5mMBtPRohrC~Y42laLWFjltqkzZhe7MBkU7rCPD4vxsCxmnPdK5Gdz6Mq7OTgZHgs6fClwJ2mGCxigZKi8CsUmWJUA90Uaa7a9NTVKbtJgUvfCowsvDvNwmmCXg2b7t2mIXN6Vy3qQUXlEqc~PKAl9obVxDrarIMUM-hF2SHuJR9wwLox3Jy4fv-3lTag9Q9arRpdG3j0rbTHbdMOAX58TpCBJA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
